//! Integration tests for BM25 full-text search (P1.3): `build_fts5_query`,
//! `Qmd::search_lex`, `extract_snippet`, context propagation and the
//! upstream golden fixture.
//!
//! Ported upstream coverage: `test/store.test.ts` FTS query/search cases
//! and `test/store-cjk-fts.test.ts`; plus the `lex_golden.json` fixture
//! generated by `scripts/gen_lex_golden.ts` against upstream v2.8.3.

